heightmode=minus
layer=com_8
textfont=verdana_11pt_regular
fontmono=no
text=Now click the "Activate" button to switch the Food for Rigging, swapping some surplus Morale for Seafaring. Your overall chance of success (the lowest of the individual stat chances) will increase to 100%.
